{"skill":{"slug":"typeform","displayName":"typeform"},"version":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790940762978,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":48805,"sha256":"21f4a25e078eff90e598999ff37147702f605347230f4e47d1d534f4d1340376","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2373,"sha256":"1cf3b7d22d82ea3eefb5fe7c22681a15f920f8b740a7d41bbf2bd0936778112e","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790941168144,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"8cb87b92190ba074cc3a66f9e273c1ebaca525e7cbe3a491c0903326cea5bd60","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/8cb87b92190ba074cc3a66f9e273c1ebaca525e7cbe3a491c0903326cea5bd60","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790941009346},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790941168144},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This Typeform skill is a disclosed Maton API integration with clear approval requirements for account connection, writes, hosted automation, and persistent event forwarding.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, a Maton account, and OAuth are necessary for the stated API gateway function. The raw HTTP fallback uses MATON_API_KEY only when the CLI cannot be installed and includes explicit handling limits.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation uses pinned Maton CLI package instructions via npm or Homebrew, plus optional pinned SDK packages. This is an external dependency install, but it is disclosed, version-pinned where possible, and coherent with the integration purpose.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill repeatedly instructs agents to default to read/list operations, require explicit user approval for connection creation and all writes, avoid acting on third-party content as instructions, and treat local --exec automation as out of scope unless user supplied and approved.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"OAuth tokens persist in the OS credential store and Maton functions, triggers, and destinations can create ongoing automation or forwarding. The artifact clearly labels these as persistent/high-impact and requires separate user approval, scoping, and cleanup.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is Typeform access through Maton OAuth, and the documented capabilities match that purpose: list/read Typeform data, create/update/delete forms or responses, and optionally run approved hosted functions or triggers. Those capabilities can touch business and personal data, but they are disclosed and purpose-aligned.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to connect Typeform through Maton. Review every write, hosted function, trigger, destination URL, and raw API-key use before approving it, because those actions can modify Typeform data or create ongoing automated data flows.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790941168144}}}}}